SUMMARY:2026 OCAD U GradEx: Creative Writing x Onsite Gallery
DESCRIPTION:2026 OCAD U GradEx: Creative Writing x Onsite Gallery \nFriday\, May 08\, 5 to 7:00 p.m. \n199 Richmond Street West \nJoin us for an evening to celebrate this year’s OCAD U Creative Writing graduating cohort. Experience a diverse showcase of poetry\, music\, theatre\, and more as students share selections from their thesis projects. Come support and enjoy an inspiring night of words\, storytelling\, and performance. \nOCAD U GradEx: Creative Writing x Onsite Gallery coincides with the current exhibitions Becoming (in the light of the miracle) and The Delaney Family Emerging Curator’s Prize: Metabolic Loop on view until May 16\, 2026. \nOnsite Gallery is generously supported by The Delaney Family.
