SUMMARY:Campari Simply Complex: The Bitter Journey
DESCRIPTION:This immersive guided tasting experience explores the iconic Negroni and its bold\, bittersweet profile. Each ticket includes a Classic Negroni\, three Negroni Family Tree variations\, and a curated food pairing from Executive Chef Nick Liu’s savoury dumpling menu\, along with a Campari keepsake. \nDesigned to demystify bitterness and highlight the simplicity at the heart of the Negroni\, this experience is perfect for both cocktail enthusiasts and those looking to explore aperitivo culture. \nTax and gratuity are included in the ticket price.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/campari-simply-complex-the-bitter-journey/
LOCATION:Charlemagne Cocktail Bar\, 100 Portland St\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2N2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 2N2
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/campari-simply-complex-the-bitter-journey.png
