SUMMARY:AGO Friday Nights: PANTHEON Collective DJ Series
DESCRIPTION:Beginning Friday\, May 8\, and continuing June 26\, and July 17\, from 6 p.m. to 9 p.m.\, DJ Collective PANTHEON(Marnigurl\, Lichen\, Lake FX\, Myles) takes over Walker Court with their signature blend of ambient\, minimal techno\, house and live electronica. Free with General Admission. For more details\, visit ago.ca/events/ago-friday-nights-panethon-collective-dj-series.
