SUMMARY:Rafi Bastos - Comfort Zone
DESCRIPTION:Rafi Bastos returns to Toronto at the Queen Elizabeth Theatre on May 8\, 2026! \nBold\, smart\, and unpredictable\, Rafi Bastos is a 6’7” Jewish-Brazilian comedy force with a killer accent and zero filter. A stand-up pioneer in Brazil turned global phenomenon\, Rafi’s Comedy Cellar sets have gone massively viral\, racking up over 370 million views. With three Netflix specials and a Shorty Award to his name\, he’s the first Brazilian comedian to headline Just For Laughs. \nGet your tickets now!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/rafi-bastos-comfort-zone/
