SUMMARY:Fortune Feimster: Takin' Care of Biscuits Comedy Tour
DESCRIPTION:Feimster continues to balance her booming stand-up career with an impressive slate of projects on screen. She’s currently in production on Will Ferrell’s Untitled Netflix Golf Comedy Series. Her latest special Crushing It can be found on Netflix\, alongside her previous specials Good Fortune and Sweet & Salty\, both of which garnered Critics Choice nominations. This fall she will lend her voice to “Nibbles” in Disney’s highly anticipated sequel Zootopia 2. Most recently she can be seen starring in season two of the Netflix comedy Fubar alongside Arnold Schwarzenegger. Additional credits include Chelsea Lately\, The Mindy Project\, Kenan\, Office Christmas Party\, and Barb and Star Go to Vista Del Mar.  On the audio front\, she hosts the popular podcast “Handsome” alongside Tig Notaro and Mae Martin; and “What A Joke with Papa and Fortune” on SiriusXM. Fresh off a wildly successful 2025 tour\, actress\, comedian\, writer\, and host Fortune Feimster is extending her “Takin’ Care of Biscuits” tour into 2026 with a special Toronto appearance you won’t want to miss. 
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/fortune-feimster-takin-care-of-biscuits-comedy-tour/
LOCATION:Massey Hall\, 178 Victoria St\, Toronto\, M5B 1T7
CATEGORIES:2SLGBTQ+,Comedy & Improv
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/fortune-feimster-takin-care-of-biscuits-comedy-tour.png
END:VEVENT
